{"name":"Felicity","hex":"#e5e4df","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Felicity","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from English."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Felicity"}],"entries":[{"title":"Felicity, California","blocks":[{"text":"Felicity is an unincorporated community in Imperial County, California. The town was established in 1986 by Jacques-Andre Istel who bought the land in the 1950s and developed it in the 1980s after selling off his parachute business. The town is \"Dedicated to Remembrance\" and named for Istel's wife Felicia. It is 2,600 acres and lies at an elevation of 285 feet."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Center_of_the_World_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Center_of_the_World_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felicity%2C_California","wikidata":"Q5441775"},{"title":"Felicity, Ohio","blocks":[{"text":"Felicity is a village in Franklin Township, Clermont County, Ohio, United States. The population was 651 at the 2020 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Felicity-Walnut-Ln-oh.jpg/330px-Felicity-Walnut-Ln-oh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felicity%2C_Ohio","wikidata":"Q1963711"},{"title":"Felicity (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Felicity is an American drama television series created by J. J. Abrams and Matt Reeves and produced by Imagine Television and Touchstone Television for the WB. Brian Grazer and Ron Howard were executive producers through Imagine Entertainment."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Felicity_%28Touchstone_Television_series%29_logo.svg/330px-Felicity_%28Touchstone_Television_series%29_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikip